<en-note><div>Meeting&nbsp;notes with <b>bold</b>, <i>italics</i>, a <a href="https://example.com/doc">link</a> and a <span style="--en-highlight:yellow;background-color: #ffef9e;">highlight</span>.</div><div><br/></div><en-media hash="884697b1b2bb4136e34ee5669e4030b6" type="image/png" width="300"/><div><en-media hash="f62b27e45a1dfb140c91a291ab586d3e" type="application/pdf"/></div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>Book the room</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>Send the agenda</div><ul style="--en-todo:true;"><li style="--en-checked:true;"><div>Newer done</div></li><li style="--en-checked:false;"><div>Newer open</div></li></ul><div style="--en-codeblock:true;"><div>const a = 1;</div><div>const b = "#not-a-tag";</div></div><table><tr><td>Item</td><td>Cost</td></tr><tr><td>Tea</td><td>3</td></tr></table><div>Secret: <en-crypt hint="the usual" cipher="AES" length="128">RU5DMAAAAAA=</en-crypt></div><script>alert(1)</script><div><img src="javascript:alert(1)"/>#not a tag either</div></en-note>]]></content>
